<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>新手佩戴水晶常见30个问题</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #111;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            font-family: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 550px;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1), inset 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-family: "STKaiti", "KaiTi", serif;
            font-size: 38px;
            font-weight: 900;
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            color: #111;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .header h2 {
            font-family: "STKaiti", "KaiTi", serif;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 900;
            margin: 0;
            color: #111;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .header h2 .highlight {
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ff5722, #bf360c);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            font-size: 36px;
            padding: 0 2px;
        }

        .separator {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 15px 0 25px 0;
        }

        .separator .line {
            height: 2px;
            width: 120px;
            background-color: #c97b39;
        }

        .placeholder {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
            border: 1px dashed #999;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .banner-icon {
            width: 40px;
            height: 24px;
            margin: 0 10px;
            border: 2px solid #c97b39;
            background-color: transparent;
            color: #c97b39;
        }

        .qa-block {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .question-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .question-text {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #000;
        }

        .question-text .q {
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-right: 4px;
        }

        .crystal-img {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin-left: 10px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .answer-text {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #333;
            font-weight: bold;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .answer-text span.text-content {
            text-shadow: 
                -1px -1px 0 #fff,  
                 1px -1px 0 #fff,
                -1px  1px 0 #fff,
                 1px  1px 0 #fff,
                 1px  1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }

        .answer-line {
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .answer-line-with-num {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .num-box {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #8da4be;
            color: #fff;
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 18px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 3px;
            margin-right: 6px;
            margin-top: 2px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            text-shadow: none;
            font-weight: normal;
        }

        .answer-indent {
            padding-left: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">
    <div class="header">
        <h1>新手佩戴水晶</h1>
        <h2>常见<span class="highlight">30</span>个问题</h2>
        <div class="separator">
            <div class="line"></div>
            <div class="placeholder banner-icon" title="Banner Icon">[图标]</div>
            <div class="line"></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="qa-block">
        <div class="question-row">
            <div class="question-text"><span class="q">Q:</span>水晶戴左手还是右手？</div>
            <div class="placeholder crystal-img" title="Yellow Crystal">[图]</div>
        </div>
        <div class="answer-text">
            <div class="answer-line-with-num">
                <span class="num-box">1</span>
                <span class="text-content">黄水晶、草莓晶、紫水晶、海蓝宝、粉晶、</span>
            </div>
            <div class="answer-indent">
                <span class="text-content">月光石、萤石等常佩戴在左手；</span>
            </div>
            <div class="answer-line-with-num">
                <span class="num-box">2</span>
                <span class="text-content">黑/银曜石、白水晶、虎眼石等常佩戴在右手。</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="qa-block">
        <div class="question-row">
            <div class="question-text"><span class="q">Q:</span>哪些水晶不能碰水？</div>
            <div class="placeholder crystal-img" title="Red Crystal">[图]</div>
        </div>
        <div class="answer-text">
            <div class="answer-line"><span class="text-content">太阳石、方解石、萤石、孔雀石、天青石</span></div>
            <div class="answer-line"><span class="text-content">青金石、海纹石、月光石、天河石、绿松石</span></div>
            <div class="answer-line"><span class="text-content">蓝铜矿、蓝晶石、堇青石、紫龙晶、紫锂辉石</span></div>
            <div class="answer-line"><span class="text-content">透石膏、灰月光、赤铁矿、紫锂云母</span></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="qa-block">
        <div class="question-row">
            <div class="question-text"><span class="q">Q:</span>水晶怎么消磁？</div>
            <div class="placeholder crystal-img" title="Pink Crystal">[图]</div>
        </div>
        <div class="answer-text">
            <div class="answer-line"><span class="text-content">碎石消磁、海盐消磁、鼠尾草消磁、月光消磁</span></div>
            <div class="answer-line"><span class="text-content">流水消磁</span></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="qa-block">
        <div class="question-row">
            <div class="question-text"><span class="q">Q:</span>不佩戴水晶的时候放哪里？</div>
            <div class="placeholder crystal-img" title="Clear Red Inclusion Crystal">[图]</div>
        </div>
        <div class="answer-text">
            <div class="answer-line-with-num">
                <span class="num-box">1</span>
                <span class="text-content">可以放在装有消磁石的盒子里存放起来；</span>
            </div>
            <div class="answer-line-with-num">
                <span class="num-box">2</span>
                <span class="text-content">可以放在水晶簇或水晶洞里面；</span>
            </div>
            <div class="answer-line-with-num">
                <span class="num-box">3</span>
                <span class="text-content">可以放一个软布在木盒，然后将水晶放里面。</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
